s.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20241115000251"},{"id":"D33","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(전환사채권발행결정)","date":"2024-06-17","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240617000166"},{"id":"D34","kind":"DART 공시","title":"주요사항보고서(전환사채권발행결정)","date":"2024-05-16","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20240516002252"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"[기재정정]사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-08-25","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250825000453"}]}